  << /ActualText (ARRIVAL \057 Product \046 Design Lead \0502015\0232022\051\nDeveloping a toolchain for configuring vehicle electric and software architecture with some automations that never existed before in automotive\056 From idea through prototype and launch to production and proved the efficiency\056 Got a number of very positive feedback from automotive engineers\056\nHands\055on designed the solution inventing ways to simplify and automate everything possible\056\nOwned the product \024 hired and was leading my 12 engineers team\056\nHired and mentored Product Designers in nearby products \050vehicle online monitoring and diagnostics\054 vehicle configuration\054 vehicle software update\051\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
